@inherits LayoutComponentBase

@*
    The sign-in shell: no header, no sidebar, no account menu — there is no account yet.

    It no longer calls into JS to apply the theme. App.razor's pre-paint script already did
    that before this component existed, and the old `initializeTheme()` call here ran AFTER
    first paint, so it could only ever repeat a decision already made or, on a slow circuit,
    undo nothing visibly. 

    `.login-shell` was `.login-page` in this file's own scoped stylesheet; renamed and moved
    into app.css alongside the sign-in pages it wraps, as a fixed scrollable grid so the open
    column centres at any viewport height without clipping on a short one.
*@
<div class="login-shell">
    @Body
</div>
